 "pages": {
  "1": {
   "title": "上週，薩米人說北極星撐著整片天空。今晚往南到白俄羅斯：同一片星空，白俄羅斯的農民看見——一本農民曆。",
   "page_id": "PBnSbkjn2BFG0Rsr"
  },
  "2": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB2J3FfQSbfrt3PR"
  },
  "3": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBQCpWy7KPvVNTmw"
  },
  "4": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBrg8b3WXJQtXRSq"
  },
  "5": {
   "title": "白俄羅斯在東歐內陸，沒有海，四成是森林，還有上千座湖。研究者發現，到了二十一世紀，村裡的老人還叫得出星星的名字。",
   "page_id": "PBGcPHpfvZcLsll3"
  },
  "6": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBPHn0t9r01yYX81"
  },
  "7": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB941DJvWVFcspq3"
  },
  "8": {
   "title": "先往北看。北極星叫 Hvozdz——釘子，整片天空就繞著這根釘子轉。蒙古人也說它是一根金樁。",
   "page_id": "PBJr4ZN5vd9540PY"
  },
  "9": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBQmb7B2cv5PLlzr"
  },
  "10": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB7SF30FrVpj2l59"
  },
  "11": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB39KCGhlvZG5VZk"
  },
  "12": {
   "title": "繞著釘子轉的，是一輛車：北斗七星叫 Voz，大車；小熊座是 Maly voz，小車。冬天的節日 Kaliady，傳說就是坐著這輛大車來的。",
   "page_id": "PB5Pkx5FH66dFMWd"
  },
  "13": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB4kCRkZPDb36zb1"
  },
  "14": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBN2mN93n5YwT63r"
  },
  "15": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBvJCyYYZkxczfBx"
  },
  "16": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBTQnwDxZ5f4hvGb"
  },
  "17": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBlQ8vntVBSYkP0v"
  },
  "18": {
   "title": "基督教傳進來以後，這輛車有了主人：先知以利亞。聖經說他沒有死——「忽有火車火馬將二人隔開，以利亞就乘旋風升天去了」。",
   "page_id": "PBwjDhd6NHc7wcQp"
  },
  "19": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB16my5m6xwNFZF5"
  },
  "20": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB4148kftxdVTjf0"
  },
  "21": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBV8lb6xCWDtWYGq"
  },
  "22": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB3sTF3xW8g8xXVn"
  },
  "23": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBLP9D9gRJ76nZjB"
  },
  "24": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PByT6GkDqgvk6dF2"
  },
  "25": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB4834d0QQd7X8D8"
  },
  "26": {
   "title": "所以北斗又叫 Illioŭ voz，以利亞的車——一輛火焰馬車。東斯拉夫民間說，夏天打雷，就是他駕著車在天上跑，閃電是他在追打魔鬼。",
   "page_id": "PBw3pMfrK99ylf6g"
  },
  "27": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB6BvZR9chldykqZ"
  },
  "28": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBM2YMQHWCR7qbR6"
  },
  "29": {
   "title": "他的節日在八月初，正是雷雨多、麥子收割的時候。也有人認為，更早以前駕這輛車的，是雷神 Perun。",
   "page_id": "PB4Zk5xF10LLgP3q"
  },
  "30": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBX5vjfGp9j3bGr1"
  },
  "31": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBcpNw6HDfBpjXG9"
  },
  "32": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBgWD2xtdGvkbJGm"
  },
  "33": {
   "title": "把北斗看成車的，不只白俄羅斯：北歐叫「男人的車」，羅馬尼亞叫「大車」；司馬遷也說「斗為帝車」——天帝的車。",
   "page_id": "PB6fTBRdqkSrhdF3"
  },
  "34": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBVKYqRbGKKBd4Bt"
  },
  "35": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBBQ9tJgjqzYnGBy"
  },
  "36": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBgGjs89yBlmwyXw"
  },
  "37": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBVMfsQYRK7h00bW"
  },
  "38": {
   "title": "往南看獵戶座。腰帶三顆星，一顆接一顆斜斜排開，像田裡一排割草的人，叫 Kastsy。下面那串小星，是耙草的耙子 Hrabli。",
   "page_id": "PBRXmfzd71RN63pL"
  },
  "39": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBS750th6RB1q4kn"
  },
  "40": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBfX17Xyt9FB4FSr"
  },
  "41": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBpn8dl8qFkkLrqN"
  },
  "42": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBcSzbD5dc1ZRlXt"
  },
  "43": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBbNHspQ3H92DlHg"
  },
  "44": {
   "title": "我們把它們放在一起看：割草、耙草，再用北邊的大車載回家——夏天打乾草的一整套，冬天全掛在天上。",
   "page_id": "PBqg038SgkTftCy0"
  },
  "45": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBZSTJG7B2bs6Lyt"
  },
  "46": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBS8R2kbNlzmL5nT"
  },
  "47": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB9bjNQdMxQRRFL7"
  },
  "48": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBw6W2p7jxXNhNgt"
  },
  "49": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBmKnjfLMlh87zHz"
  },
  "50": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBrdt61QXw5DMs5z"
  },
  "51": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBjblgdNR401VFPV"
  },
  "52": {
   "title": "春天的天上還有更多農具：牧夫座是犁田的人 Rataj；后髮座那幾顆暗星是篩子 Sita——老人說，上帝曾經拿它篩黑麥。",
   "page_id": "PBkSWrj32n1kjxXz"
  },
  "53": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBcpGsNZhYrFJ8N2"
  },
  "54": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB9t88k70t5fRqWF"
  },
  "55": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB1H2W2txtt8sW3M"
  },
  "56": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB20mH5fVTjtJNSp"
  },
  "57": {
   "title": "還有一院子的動物：昴宿是一群母雞 Kurki，畢宿是幾條草蛇，五車二是母山羊 Kaza，白羊座，就是院子裡的公羊。",
   "page_id": "PBBNKk6QMsWdNrhh"
  },
  "58": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PByj9lyVjqtpQ6h4"
  },
  "59": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBjw6191z4ZNtsqT"
  },
  "60": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBRFKZqC2WbwTYHq"
  },
  "61": {
   "title": "同一片天，後來也慢慢變成一座教堂：整個獵戶座是耶穌的椅子；北冕座是荊棘冠，天鵝座是聖彼得的十字架。",
   "page_id": "PBFz9qs9lD16RR73"
  },
  "62": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBzZCQZfb7wQCGxX"
  },
  "63": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBv89kKHJhqpt2Q0"
  },
  "64": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBG7m8KK2BfpPGTl"
  },
  "65": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBfBfC15mJ360Zjc"
  },
  "66": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBfjcmmzyzfWpKRY"
  },
  "67": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBj1rSCDFKv7G8Qw"
  },
  "68": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBBxYl3t2rMcTJq8"
  },
  "69": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBZPRkwBFQxnVh3z"
  },
  "70": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBSY18fbgkpN7l6y"
  },
  "71": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBznv9p3V8qHqtqq"
  },
  "72": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBQVqNhcX7Hp7vcN"
  },
  "73": {
   "title": "天龍座，是聖喬治殺死的那條蛇，被他掛在那顆「永遠不動的星」旁邊——巧的是，這條蛇的身體，正好疊在中國紫微垣的城牆上。",
   "page_id": "PB35WyD48R9LX8jn"
  },
  "74": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBx54M5T0405FGCy"
  },
  "75": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBfX44NyCGrzvrw9"
  },
  "76": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBRXzw1vdNCtZ5Th"
  },
  "77": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBjgXyXJlQLW6bBY"
  },
  "78": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB0DcpJchymYY7gp"
  },
  "79": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBws5JPXps266dTX"
  },
  "80": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBSdzszDXGP8HLqH"
  },
  "81": {
   "title": "雙子座的兩顆亮星，代表幾百年前的兩個國家：波蘭和立陶宛——白俄羅斯這塊地，就在立陶宛那一邊。",
   "page_id": "PBwcRcWVM3T7wDPJ"
  },
  "82": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PB3tsvNgdCjCK9PN"
  },
  "83": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBxsm98F75zYB8Vj"
  },
  "84": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBqQ7ms8T2LGDVTb"
  },
  "85": {
   "title": "這集的白俄羅斯星名，整理成一張小辭典，可以存起來。",
   "page_id": "PBgqZfyJph4k4h8S"
  },
  "86": {
   "title": "",
   "page_id": "PBDVR1ldFjBR4y2H"
  },
  "87": {
   "title": "這幾天在台灣：天一黑，割草的人就在南方高空；九點以後，北斗從東北方爬上來。今晚東方，月亮下面是木星和衝日的火星；明晚元宵，月亮就停在它們中間。",
   "page_id": "PBk0fm9hFRt9D6FX"
  },
